        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 7512, Gravity Door Pivot Hinge Surface Mounted</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBommer 7512 Gravity Door Pivot Hinge, Surface Mounted. Cast Steel construction pivot hinge for doors up to 30 Inches Wide, 7/8\" to 1-5/8\" Inches Thick with a Maximum Door Weight of 50 lbs. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: With hold open use <a href=\"/products/surface-mount-gravity-pivot-hinge-with-hold-open-bommer-7512-h\"><b>Bommer 7512-H  Pivot Hinge with Hold Open</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/box-clamp-mount-louvered-door-gravity-pivot-hinge-bommer-7514\"><b>Bommer 7514</b></a> Box Clamp Mount Gravity Door Pivot Hinge.\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBommer Industries has been in business since 1876, with over 125 years of quality products. Their products are American made with American steel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Louver Door Gravity Pivot Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Width: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Thickness: For Louvered Doors 7/8\" to 1-5/8\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight: 50 lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Steel Construction</li>\r\n<li>Surface Mounted Pivot</li>\r\n<li>Double Acting</li>\r\n<li>Door weight closes door. No Springs</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Flat Door Bracket: For doors not less than 7/8\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Flat Jamb Bracket: 1-1/4\" Wide</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with #10 - 1\" Flat Head Wood Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/7512.pdf?v=1691094994\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 7512 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a> </li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/7512-install.pdf?v=1691094994\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 7512 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a> </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSold individually as a set, with 1 pivot , 1 each jamb and door bracket, 1 top pivot assembly with jamb bracket, and mounting hardware. Enough to do one door.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued.  <p>\r\nDirect Fit Replacement Available: <a href=\"/products/surface-mount-gravity-door-pivot-hinge-pbb-b7512\"><b>Surface Mount Gravity Door Pivot Hinge, PBB-B7512</b></a>\r\n</p></b>\r\n<br><br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
